# tuning: macros/tuning_parameters_hkfd.mac
# HK generic FD cylinder (WCSim/WCSim develop e2dc7a48 /WCSim/WCgeom HyperK, BoxandLine20inchHQE) at 20 % coverage; the
# obsolete-geometry exit commented out (src/wcsim_hk_hits.patch). PMTs placed individually, no position variation. No QE,
# no collection efficiency, no dark noise (run.sh). Sources follow.
/run/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/hits/verbose 0
/WCSim/SetPMTPercentCoverage 20
/WCSim/WCgeom HyperK
/WCSim/PMT/ReplicaPlacement false
/WCSim/PMT/PositionVariation 0 mm
/WCSim/PMT/TankRadiusChange 0 0 0 mm
/WCSim/Construct
